{
    "$comment": [
        "图集描述（0.6.5 T-17）：**一张图里有哪些动画**。它不是组件，产物里只有",
        "一份 inking::AtlasData + 一个访问函数（AtlasSlime()），运行期由",
        "inking::MakeSpriteData() 转成某个 InkingSprite 的配置。",
        "",
        "与 Image/*.json 的 sheet 段的分工：那边是'一张图一个动画、等宽等高'；",
        "这里是'一张图多个动画、帧宽高可以不等'。两者产出的都是 SpriteData。",
        "",
        "每个动画的 frames 有两种给法，二选一：",
        "  · frames: [{x,y,width,height}, …]  —— 逐帧绝对矩形（不规则排版）；",
        "  · columns / rows / frameWidth / frameHeight / count / firstFrame —— 网格。",
        "网格会在**生成期**展开成逐帧矩形，所以运行期只有一条路（帧表）。",
        "",
        "source 是**相对资源根**的路径（运行期由 AssetLoad 读），生成期不读那张图。",
        "本配置对应的图（assets/slime.png）不在仓库里：它是格式样例，",
        "编译自检只验'读得懂 + 生成物编得过'，不验像素。"
    ],
    "name": "slime",
    "animations": [
        {
            "name": "idle",
            "source": "slime.png",
            "fps": 6,
            "loop": true,
            "frames": [
                { "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 64, "height": 64 },
                { "x": 64, "y": 0, "width": 64, "height": 64 },
                { "x": 128, "y": 0, "width": 64, "height": 64 },
                { "x": 192, "y": 0, "width": 64, "height": 64 }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "jump",
            "source": "slime.png",
            "fps": 10,
            "loop": false,
            "frames": [
                { "x": 0, "y": 64, "width": 72, "height": 64 },
                { "x": 72, "y": 64, "width": 72, "height": 80 },
                { "x": 144, "y": 64, "width": 72, "height": 64 }
            ],
            "events": [ { "frame": 1, "name": "apex" } ]
        },
        {
            "name": "walk",
            "source": "slime.png",
            "fps": 8,
            "loop": true,
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 4,
            "frameWidth": 64,
            "frameHeight": 64,
            "firstFrame": 12,
            "count": 6
        }
    ]
}
